name: the lock does not say which process is holding it
file: tools/mutate.py
--- old
    handle.write("%s\t%s\t%d\t%s\t%s\n" % (time.strftime("%H:%M:%S"), what, os.getpid(),
                                           os.getcwd(), extra))
--- new
    handle.write("%s\t%s\t\t\t%s\n" % (time.strftime("%H:%M:%S"), what, extra))
